// well-formedness of the contract of countdown: the measure **pp is read in the entry state under owns(*pp), nothing in the contract can be undefined
method f_countdown__0__wf(p_pp: Ref, a0: Perm, a1: Perm, hv_0_pre: Ref, hv_0_post: Ref, hv_1_pre: Int, hv_1_post: Int)
